                ],
                "id": "9a0v1pbnqwf9p3j",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "In the reaction as written, Ag is oxidized and Fe"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "2+"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is reduced. First use the standard reduction potentials for the half-reactions to determine the standard cell potential:"
